WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.328
Sara and Sam walked.

2
00:00:11.329 --> 00:00:14.267
Sam grabbed a rock.

3
00:00:14.268 --> 00:00:19.165
He got ready to throw it.

4
00:00:19.166 --> 00:00:22.479
"Let's play a game," Sara said quickly.

5
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.865
"I see something green.

6
00:00:25.866 --> 00:00:32.014
What is it?"

7
00:00:32.015 --> 00:00:35.891
Sam shrugged. "A leaf?"

8
00:00:35.892 --> 00:00:41.923
Sara smiled. "Nope!"

9
00:00:41.924 --> 00:00:44.965
"What is it?" Sam asked.

10
00:00:44.966 --> 00:00:50.472
"You must guess," Sara said.

11
00:00:50.473 --> 00:00:53.734
"Is it grass?" Sam asked.

12
00:00:53.735 --> 00:00:58.982
Sara shook her head.

13
00:00:58.983 --> 00:01:02.371
"Oh! I know!" Sam said.

14
00:01:02.372 --> 00:01:05.030
"Is it moss?"

15
00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:08.540
"Yes!" Sara smiled.

16
00:01:08.541 --> 00:01:11.443
"It is moss!"

17
00:01:11.444 --> 00:01:14.809
Sam jumped up and down.

18
00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:17.554
"Let's play again!"

19
00:01:17.555 --> 00:01:29.408
Sara and Sam walked and played.

20
00:01:29.409 --> 00:01:32.980
Finally they found Sam's mom.

21
00:01:32.981 --> 00:01:40.201
"Sam!" she cried.

22
00:01:40.202 --> 00:01:44.955
"I was looking for you!"

23
00:01:44.956 --> 00:01:48.820
Sam's mom thanked Sara.

24
00:01:48.821 --> 00:01:51.970
"No problem," Sara said.

25
00:01:51.971 --> 00:01:54.858
"It was fun!"

26
00:01:54.859 --> 00:01:58.425
"Did you have fun, Sam?" Mom asked.

27
00:01:58.426 --> 00:02:03.919
Sam looked at Sara and smiled.

28
00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:08.782
"Yes!"

